' SAFETY: AI-assisted golden example. The author reviews, validates and simulates the job,
' then a human approves the gated push (HITL). Authors a MOTION job-list only; collision
' zones, safety planes and E-stop stay on the TMflow robot controller, never in this job.
'
' Techman TMflow job-list: pick from A, place at B, return home.
' POINTs are taught poses (x, y, z, rx, ry, rz) in the robot base frame [mm, rad].
POINT PICKA  = (450, -150, 200, 3.142, 0, 0)
POINT PLACEB = (450, 150, 200, 3.142, 0, 0)

HOME
MOVE PICKA
GRIP
WAIT t=300
MOVEL PLACEB
RELEASE
WAIT t=300
HOME
